{
  "slug": "docpler",
  "name": "Docpler",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Convert Korean HWP (한글 워드프로세서) documents to Markdown. HWP is the most widely used document format in South Korea,\ncommonly found in government, legal, and academic documents. This plugin provides a high-performance Rust-based CLI to\nconvert HWP 5.0 files to Markdown directly within Claude Code.\n\nThis product was developed with reference to the HWP document file (.hwp) specification published by Hancom\n(https://www.hancom.com/etc/hwpDownload.do).",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill**, `hwp-convert` (Convert Korean HWP (한글) document files to Markdown).\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install docpler@claude-community` from `docpler/docpler-claude-plugin`.\n\nClaude Code plugin for converting HWP (Korean word processor) documents to Markdown.",
  "compatibility": [
